&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At Recursion, we believe that every employee should be compensated fairly. Based on the skills, experience, and qualifications needed for this role, the estimated annual base salary range is:&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;$200,000–$220,500&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;In addition to base salary, this role is eligible for an annual bonus, equity compensation, and a comprehensive benefits package.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-EP1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Values We Hope You Share:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
